Linkpile NEWS
=============

1.0
---

  * Tag suggestions while you type in the post form. Your own tags
    that match the word you are typing show up underneath, with no
    page reload (uses XMLHttpRequest). Click one to use it.
  * Fixed the tags box dropping below the bookmark list in Internet
    Explorer 6 (double margin float bug and the 3 pixel jog).
  * Added INSTALL and this NEWS file.

0.5
---

  * RSS 2.0 feeds for recent bookmarks, for every user, for every tag,
    and for a user's bookmarks with one tag.
  * Bookmarklet: post the page you are looking at with one click,
    then jump straight back to it.
  * Tag cloud of every tag on the site.
  * "Popular this week" page, showing the links saved by the most
    people in the last seven days.

0.1
---

  * First release.
  * Accounts with registration, login and logout.
  * Save bookmarks with a title, notes and tags.
  * Pages for each user and each tag, with related tags.
  * Edit and delete your own bookmarks.
